From adef67a17c6d56a9d65e52c6b9c0b27e3e3d26dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nassos Yiannopoulos <nassosyian@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:51:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 13/54] hw/display/pvg: constant globals, 16-bit draw layouts
 from the decoders, 32-bit indices

air2spv: serialise constant global initialisers into Private arrays and
read 8/16-bit elements from private memory. Executor: decode
DrawInstanced16/DrawIndexed[Instanced]16 as the PGDeserializerRenderDecoder
does (packed u16 fields, index type), dump failed functions, and track
executor writes by guest-physical page in dump mode.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
